    "catalog:tags": "bed, bunk, single, bedroom, children",
    "catalog:note": "Bunk bed, two mattresses 0.90 x 2.00: four posts, a head panel to the floor, two frames, guard rails both sides of the upper bunk, a vertical ladder at the foot. top 0.45 is the lower mattress, top 1.40 the upper (unverified). The plan shows the upper bunk, overhead of the lower one. The ladder lies within 0.03 of the foot edge, so the plan does not draw it. The ladder stiles of radius 0.015 build as prisms.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "EU common bed sizes, unverified (UK sizes differ; EN 1334 is the measurement method, not the sizes); drafting standard key dimensions",
